---
// Raster multibanda: le bande sono griglie sovrapposte, e ogni cella porta un valore per banda.
---

<figure class="my-8">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 660 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="bande-title" class="h-auto w-full text-foreground">
    <title id="bande-title">
      Tre griglie sovrapposte, una per banda: la stessa cella contiene un valore distinto in
      ciascuna banda.
    </title>

    <rect x="150" y="56" width="132" height="88" class="fill-background" />
    <rect x="216" y="78" width="22" height="22" class="fill-foreground" opacity="0.45" />
    <line x1="150" y1="56" x2="150" y2="144" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <line x1="172" y1="56" x2="172" y2="144" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <line x1="194" y1="56" x2="194" y2="144" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <line x1="216" y1="56" x2="216" y2="144" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <line x1="238" y1="56" x2="238" y2="144" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="0.8" />
